        "content": "## Update HubSpot Property\n\nLow-stakes, reversible write — per Rule 9, no HITL gate needed, but still guarded by needs_review (identity uncertainty, not action risk) and a property allowlist (the agent can only touch qualification fields, never anything structural).\n\nhubspot_contact_id and needs_review are TRUSTED inputs wired from Workflow B's context — never let the agent supply these itself.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 460
      },
